r strategic advantage.Recruit and TrainFind allies across your journey, each with unique skills and backgrounds. Level them up to face increasingly difficult enemies and shape your team to suit your playstyle.Make Story Altering DecisionsNavigate a web of shifting loyalties in a morally complex world. Choose carefully—each decision can sway the fate of friend and foe alike.FeaturesTactical turn-based combat: Rewarding careful planning and positioning over blind luck.Dynamic character growth: Level up, change classes, equip custom gear, and hone your recruits into elite warriors.Gripping story: Explore a world caught in endless conflict and uncover the truth behind it.Meaningful choices: Your decisions shape the world around you, altering gameplay and outcomes."}